{"id":1060402,"chapter_id":1060402,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>他和预想中不一样，还以为醒来以后会变得强势点。怎么比躺着时还要软蛋。</i></color>","female_content":"<color=#7683a2><i>她和预想中不一样，还以为醒来以后会变得强势点。怎么比躺着时还要软蛋。</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_1","vo_trial_60402_1_1f"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402002,"trial_step":2,"drawing":1060404},{"step":2,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>他或许还不知道吧，上庭的那混蛋要我放他自由……我找到他了，可我要做的，却恰恰相反。</i></color>","female_content":"<color=#7683a2><i>她或许还不知道吧，上庭的那混蛋要我放她自由……我找到她了，可我要做的，却恰恰相反。</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_2","vo_trial_60402_1_2f"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402003,"trial_step":3,"drawing":1060404},{"step":3,"content":"盯着我笑什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402004,"trial_step":4,"drawing":1060404},{"step":4,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"久别重逢，见到故人，不应该开心吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402005,"trial_step":5,"drawing":1060404},{"step":5,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"还是说……","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1060404},{"step":6,"content":"可可莉克挑起自己的一丝头发，逗猫似的在你手边打转。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1060404},{"step":7,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"难道你一觉睡醒就已经把我忘了吗？局长~","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1060402},{"step":8,"options":["我不记得你","我见过“业师”"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402009,"trial_step":9,"course":3,"drawing":1060402,"choices":[{"text":"我不记得你","goto":10},{"text":"我见过“业师”","goto":13}]},{"step":9,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"啊呀，那真是可惜了。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1060402},{"step":10,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"你或许只记得月下花前佳人在侧，却忘了屏风之后咄咄逼人的反派角色了。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1060402},{"step":11,"content":"你确定那真的是你吗……隔着屏风，我们并不能算是“见过”。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1060402,"next":[15]},{"step":12,"content":"禁闭者堇第一次出逃后，我是从“业师”手上将她带回的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1060402},{"step":13,"content":"但当时我们隔着屏风，你怎么证明那个“业师”就是你？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1060402,"next":[15]},{"step":14,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"别那么扫兴嘛，更亲切的关系，对你我都有好处~","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1060402},{"step":15,"content":"她调笑着向你凑近，甚至无视了身上的伤口，都试图要触摸你肌肤的温度。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1060402},{"step":16,"content":"你第一时间与她拉开了距离。这不是单纯的“引诱”，你的枷锁清晰感受到癫狂的暗涌正在攀升，正在和枷锁不断纠缠。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1060402},{"step":17,"options":["你想做什么？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402018,"trial_step":18,"course":3,"drawing":1060402,"choices":[{"text":"你想做什么？","goto":19}]},{"step":18,"content":"枷锁的存在能抑制狂厄，你不用太抵触它。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1060402},{"step":19,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"真严肃啊，我逗你玩呢。只是想试试传说中的狗绳是不是真的那么牢靠而已~别那么小心眼，会被禁闭者们嫌弃的。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1060402},{"step":20,"content":"她嘴上服软，肢体动作和M值并没有做出丝毫退让。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1060402},{"step":21,"content":"好啊，想“玩”枷锁的话，我可以配合你，但你也得陪我玩个游戏。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1060402},{"step":22,"content":"告诉我，关于我昏迷期间新城所发生的事件中，你所知道的全部内容，我们交换。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1060402},{"step":23,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"我还以为是多大的事呢，告诉你也无妨~","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1060400},{"step":24,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"我麾下的一朵康乃馨受了蒙骗，接了一桩危险的委托。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1060401},{"step":25,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"我看不得自己的小花儿被这种腌臜事折腾，所以出手帮了她。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1060401},{"step":26,"content":"她轻飘飘地陈述着，一边把玩着着自己的指甲。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1060401},{"step":27,"content":"别装傻，这里不吃这套。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1060401},{"step":28,"content":"是谁给你的委托？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1060401},{"step":29,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"委托人？不重要了，你找不到她。她先坏了规矩，牵连了花园的小花，已经成为花泥了。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1060401},{"step":30,"content":"委托里目标对象是谁。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1060401},{"step":31,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"瑟琳，一个上庭混蛋。顺便，再给FAC添些乱。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1060401},{"step":32,"content":"为什么针对她？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1060401},{"step":33,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"不追根究底是刺客保命的秘诀。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1060401},{"step":34,"content":"……那为什么要牵连其他人？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1060401},{"step":35,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"顺手而为的正义仪式。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1060401},{"step":36,"content":"其中的内幕你什么都不知道？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1060401},{"step":37,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"不知道~","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1060400},{"step":38,"content":"她在审讯椅上重新调整了一个舒服的姿势，手指似有似无地向你的方向靠近，无辜地眨眨眼睛。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1060400},{"step":39,"content":"可可莉克并没有信任你，她的态度只透露出敷衍。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1060400},{"step":40,"content":"为了一个什么都不知道的委托，让花园和上庭对抗，甚至差点全军覆没。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1060400},{"step":41,"content":"愿意付出这样大的代价，你觉得我会相信你，什么都不知道吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1060400},{"step":42,"content":"你与可可莉克抽开了距离，将一叠厚厚的物证放在了她面前。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1060400},{"step":43,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":44,"course":6,"drawing":1060400},{"step":44,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":44,"course":6,"drawing":1060400},{"step":45,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":44,"course":6,"drawing":1060400},{"step":46,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":44,"course":6,"drawing":1060400},{"step":47,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":44,"course":6,"drawing":1060400},{"step":48,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":44,"course":6,"drawing":1060400},{"step":49,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":44,"course":6,"drawing":1060400},{"step":50,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":44,"course":6,"drawing":1060400},{"step":51,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"让我看看我们的小局长都查到了什么？","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1060403},{"step":52,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"哦哦~“花园建立之初就一直以上庭人士和反狂厄作战要员为主要目标。花园的兵器物资来源，和地底有很深的牵扯。”","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1060403},{"step":53,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"“她们甚至能用未知手段将普通人催化成禁闭者。目前已知拥有这种技术的只有……”","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1060403},{"step":54,"content":"帕尔玛，以及——","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1060403},{"step":55,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"帕尔玛的狗主人，地底势力哈哈哈哈哈哈！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1060402},{"step":56,"content":"她看着你一脸严肃的表情笑得停不下来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1060402},{"step":57,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"你什么都知道，何必还在这里和我演戏呢？","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1060402},{"step":58,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"没错，曾经是有一群自以为是的人，养育了这个地方，操纵着名为“业师”的傀儡，招揽那些可怜的小花。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1060402},{"step":59,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"曾经我也是其中之一，被“我的业师”招揽，受“业师”启发，驾驭力量，为她卖命。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1060402},{"step":60,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"但他们忘了一件事，花是花，狗是狗，我们和帕尔玛那群烂泥不一样。有的花，可是有毒的~","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1060402},{"step":61,"content":"她拿起你手中的调查报告，看着你们对地底的各种猜想，像是面对着什么毫无价值的垃圾似的，将它们散落在地上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1060402},{"step":62,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"我不喜欢替人卖命，更讨厌那些自诩英伟的操盘者。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1060404},{"step":63,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"于是，我为“业师”献上了最华丽的表演！用她教我的最快最狠最痛的方式，带走了她的一切。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1060404},{"step":64,"content":"也包括“业师”的位置。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1060404},{"step":65,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"局长可真是个爱动脑筋的好孩子啊，要是我的花园里也能多一些像你这样的机灵鬼就好了~","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1060404},{"step":66,"content":"她故作娇弱地嗔笑着，又向你靠近了一些。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1060402},{"step":67,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"不过说到底，我只是个善良又美丽的少女。就算我坐上了“业师”的位置，还是摆脱不了地底的控制。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1060402},{"step":68,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"还记得我刚刚说的委托人吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1060402},{"step":69,"content":"不是说已经成为“花泥”了吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1060402},{"step":70,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"啊呀，差点忘了告诉你了，她在实现这一价值前，还有自己的名字呢——希格尔。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1060402},{"step":71,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"她和帕尔玛的人一样，会溃烂为一团恶心的淤水。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1060402},{"step":72,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"我也是很忙的，没时间追究淤水的死活。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1060400},{"step":73,"content":"可可莉克托着腮，意味深长地看着你，似乎在等待一个有趣的答案。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1060400},{"step":74,"content":"淤水还能复生，我见过相似的场面。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1060400},{"step":75,"content":"你的意思是说，地下派出和花园联络的这个希格尔，有可能还活着？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1060400},{"step":76,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"那就只能看你的努力咯~加油，局长弟弟。","female_content":"那就只能看你的努力咯~加油，局长妹妹。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_69","vo_trial_60402_1_69f"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1060400},{"step":77,"content":"你刚刚还自称少女……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1060400},{"step":78,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"没礼貌！不可以深究娇花的年龄哦。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1060400},{"step":79,"content":"她也只是佯装责怪，很快恢复了平时捉摸不透的笑意，一双冰冷苍白的手已经握住了你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1060400},{"step":80,"options":["你要做什么？","推开她"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402074,"trial_step":74,"course":3,"drawing":1060400,"choices":[{"text":"你要做什么？","goto":75},{"text":"推开她","goto":78}]},{"step":81,"content":"和刺客发生肢体接触，只会让我陷入不利吧？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1060400},{"step":82,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"但你也没有逃开呀，是还在期待我说些什么吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1060400},{"step":83,"content":"因为你还没有说出全部实情。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1060400,"next":[81]},{"step":84,"content":"她虽然负伤，但毕竟是狂厄级禁闭者，你的反抗没有奏效，冰凉的指节沿着你手臂的方向不断向上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1060400},{"step":85,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"我那么配合你，你就别拒绝了嘛。我给你的信息应该已经够你忙活好一阵了。","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1060400},{"step":86,"content":"你确实给出了有用的信息，但应该还没有说出全部实情？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1060400,"next":[81]},{"step":87,"content":"既然不喜欢被地底控制，那为什么还要继续接下这份委托？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1060400},{"step":88,"content":"发现自己被卷入纷争后，明哲保身才更像一个刺客的作风。你的目的又是什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1060400},{"step":89,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"还真是个好奇心旺盛的孩子啊……不过，这跟一开始说好的“交换信息”不一样？","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1060400},{"step":90,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"是不是该给我看看你的诚意了——","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1060404},{"step":91,"content":"可可莉克指了指自己身上的红色暗芒，伪装出一脸天真。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1060404},{"step":92,"content":"你想问什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1060404},{"step":93,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"嗯……先说说看它是如何<color=#fb9259><b>拴住</b></color>禁闭者的吧？","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1060404},{"step":94,"content":"它虽然名为枷锁，但我从来没有把它当做一种束缚。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1060404},{"step":95,"content":"我会用它抑制禁闭者的狂厄，但不会用它“栓住”任何人。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1060404},{"step":96,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"哦？即便是禁闭者要用力量伤害你，你也不会强制她们停下吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1060404},{"step":97,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"比如说——像这样？","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1060404},{"step":98,"content":"可可莉克的指甲深深掐入你的手腕，你开始觉得刺痛。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1060405},{"step":99,"content":"你对我似乎有很强的敌意，但却主动被MBCC收容……你究竟想从我这里获取什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1060405},{"step":100,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"获取？别开玩笑了，难道我说了，你就会答应吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1060405},{"step":101,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"亲爱的局长大人，只要你活着，枷锁就永远无法挣脱不是吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1060405},{"step":102,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"使用着这样不公平的力量，就少说这些冠冕堂皇的好话了！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1060405},{"step":103,"content":"枷锁传来滚烫的触感，邪恶的力量正在从她的那一端，源源不断的传递过来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1060405},{"step":104,"content":"为了搞清更多信息，你并没有将手抽离。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1060405},{"step":105,"content":"你不说真话，怎么知道我们是否是盟友呢？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1060405},{"step":106,"content":"如果地底把花园卷入这件事情中，是为了转移FAC的注意力……那你呢？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1060405},{"step":107,"content":"接受委托、暴露地底、主动落网、现在又频繁试探枷锁的底线……真的只是一时兴起吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1060405},{"step":108,"content":"只要你告诉我你的诉求，我可以帮你。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1060405},{"step":109,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"不需要，我的大英雄~花园只为自己盛开！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_102"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1060405},{"step":110,"content":"更强烈的刺痛传来，好像瞄准了你的土壤开始生根发芽般，你感受到自己额前正在冒出细密的汗珠。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1060405},{"step":111,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"就像我加入花园没有原因没有目的，我只是憎恶一切束缚！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1060405},{"step":112,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"是FAC和上庭阻碍了花朵的盛放，挣脱它们正合我意！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1060405},{"step":113,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"我的花园就是这样的组织！就是在花期之内自由而热烈的存在！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1060405},{"step":114,"content":"“阻碍和束缚”，也包含MBCC和我，是吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1060405},{"step":115,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"哈哈哈哈哈哈恭喜你，猜对了！但也已经晚了！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_108"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1060405},{"step":116,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"我要将你作为最后的作品！拉着你所象征的拘束和命运一起，去见终结的倒计时！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1060405},{"step":117,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"咳咳咳……！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_110"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1060405},{"step":118,"content":"狂厄对她的反噬异常强烈，你们紧贴的几寸肌肤已经十分滚烫。但她丝毫没有松开的意思，那股力量正霸道地在你体内游走。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1060405},{"step":119,"content":"不似骸那般能轻易察觉到它具象的痕迹，这更像是一股弥散腐烂之气的青烟，毫无规律地侵占着你的精神。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1060405},{"step":120,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"怎么，还不用你引以为傲的枷锁来束缚我吗！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_113"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1060405},{"step":121,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"拴住我！让我停下！施展你的愤怒你的压迫！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_114"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1060405},{"step":122,"content":"停手吧可可莉克，再这么下去，我们都会承受不住！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1060405},{"step":123,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"呵呵呵呵咳咳咳！……我活得够灿烂了，现在更想看看，你的枷锁和它，到底谁能见到未来的太阳！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_116"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1060406},{"step":124,"content":"痛觉从手臂一直蔓延到心肺，甚至牵动着你的五脏六腑。头晕、恶心、寒意……所有糟糕的体验包裹着你，你甚至已经开始不受控制的颤抖。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1060406},{"step":125,"content":"可可莉克那边也好不到哪里去，但她像是已经对这些麻痹了，只是兴奋地看着你痛苦的表情，燃烧自己的生命。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1060406},{"step":126,"content":"在抵抗收容的时候明明已经耗尽了异能，现在这股异能到底是……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1060406},{"step":127,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"是以我自身为代价抽取的力量啊……喜欢吗？这股霸道的、污秽的、死亡的气息！它就这样一直在我体内，停滞我的成长，吞噬我的精神……","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_120"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1060406},{"step":128,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"喜欢的话我还有很多！我和狂厄早就达成了契约，这股恶心的力量在我身体里取之不尽！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1060406},{"step":129,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"我就是要用这份恶心的力量，撕下你花言巧语下假惺惺的面具！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1060406},{"step":130,"content":"还要我重复几遍……枷锁不是用来束缚禁闭者的工具！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1060406},{"step":131,"content":"但你的狂厄情况，必须有人限制！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1060406},{"step":132,"options":["释放枷锁"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402126,"trial_step":126,"course":3,"drawing":1060406,"choices":[{"text":"释放枷锁","goto":127}]},{"step":133,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"哈……果然……！","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_126"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1060404},{"step":134,"content":"她虚弱地抬起眼，哂笑着看向身周暗红的棘刺。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1060404},{"step":135,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"果然你们这些带着使命和头衔的人，最爱讲这些冠冕堂皇的好听话了！最后不还是放出枷锁了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_128"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402129,"trial_step":129,"drawing":1060404},{"step":136,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"你骗得了别的妹妹，可糊弄不了我……","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_129"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1060404},{"step":137,"content":"铁锈味涌出堵住了喉咙，你渐渐感到恼火。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1060404},{"step":138,"content":"我从头到尾没有一句谎言，倒是你！人都快死了，还说什么空话？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1060404},{"step":139,"content":"别钻牛角尖了，先控制你的狂厄，冷静下来！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1060404},{"step":140,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"呵……想要……证明你们对禁闭者的善意吗——","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_133"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1060404},{"step":141,"content":"她气弱声嘶地喃喃，思绪似乎飘出去很远。想到那些成功逃离的花园禁闭者，想到没有局长的未来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1060404},{"step":142,"content":"她为你拨开被汗浸湿的刘海，靠近你的耳边，带着笑意吐出最后的气息。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402136,"trial_step":136,"drawing":1060404},{"step":143,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"那就和我一起，被狂厄，蚕食殆尽吧……","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_137"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1060404},{"step":144,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"他们那么期待你……让我看看……耗尽你之后，那些混蛋精彩的表情……","voice":["vo_trial_60402_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_coquelicot_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1060404},{"step":145,"content":"痛感深入骨髓，你们二人的意识一同坠入的深渊。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402140,"trial_step":140},{"step":146,"content":"等夜莺带领警卫和医疗部赶到时，只看到了陷入昏迷的局长和可可莉克，以及二人肌肤接触的地方生长出的虞美人。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402141,"trial_step":141},{"step":147,"content":"那是花园实现目标后，留下的标记。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160402142,"trial_step":142}]}